    pharm: "1. IM Adrenaline (Epinephrine) 0.5mg (0.5mL of 1:1000) anterolateral thigh, repeat every 5-15 mins as needed. 2. IV Normal Saline 1L bolus rapidly, repeat as needed. 3. High-flow O2 15L/min via non-rebreather mask. 4. IV Chlorphenamine 10mg. 5. IV Hydrocortisone 200mg. 6. Nebulised Salbutamol 5mg + Ipratropium 0.5mg for bronchospasm. 7. If refractory, IV Adrenaline infusion: start at 0.05-0.1 mcg/kg/min and titrate.",
